{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":126,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਛੁਟਕਾਰੇ ਦੇ ਲਈ ਪ੍ਰਾਰਥਨਾ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਯਾਤਰਾ ਦਾ ਗੀਤ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਜਦ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਸੀਯੋਨ ਦੇ ਗ਼ੁਲਾਮਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਮੋੜ ਲੈ ਆਇਆ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤਦ ਅਸੀਂ ਸੁਫ਼ਨੇ ਵੇਖਣ ਵਾਲਿਆਂ ਵਰਗੇ ਸੀ!","poem":1},{"noteId":64}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤਦ ਸਾਡੇ ਮੂੰਹ ਹਾਸੇ ਨਾਲ ਭਰ ਗਏ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਸਾਡੀਆਂ ਜੀਭਾਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਜੈਕਾਰਾ ਸੀ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤਦ ਕੌਮਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਇਹ ਆਖਿਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਸੀ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਨੇ ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਲਈ ਵੱਡੇ-ਵੱਡੇ ਕੰਮ ਕੀਤੇ ਹਨ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਨੇ ਸਾਡੇ ਲਈ ਵੱਡੇ-ਵੱਡੇ ਕੰਮ ਕੀਤੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਸੀਂ ਅਨੰਦ ਹੋਏ ਹਾਂ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ, ਸਾਡੇ ਗ਼ੁਲਾਮਾਂ ਨੂੰ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਦੱਖਣ ਦੀਆਂ ਨਦੀਆਂ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਮੋੜ ਲਿਆ","poem":1},{"noteId":65},{"text":"!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਹੜੇ ਹੰਝੂਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਬੀਜਦੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਜੈਕਾਰਿਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਵੱਢਣਗੇ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਹੜਾ ਬੀਜਣ ਲਈ ਬੀਜ ਚੁੱਕ ਕੇ ਰੋਂਦਾ ਹੋਇਆ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਜ਼ਰੂਰ ਜੈਕਾਰਿਆਂ ਨਾਲ ਭਰੀਆਂ ਚੁੱਕ ਕੇ ਆਵੇਗਾ!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":64,"caller":"+","text":"ਜਦ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਗੁਲਾਮਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਸਿਯੋਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਲੈ ਆਇਆ ਤਦ ਉਸ ਨੇ ਸਿਯੋਨ ਨੂੰ ਮੁੜ ਤੋਂ ਬਹਾਲ ਕੀਤਾ","reference":{"chapter":126,"verse":1}},{"noteId":65,"caller":"+","text":"ਬਹਾਲ","reference":{"chapter":126,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/126.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/127.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/125.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}